{{!
    @template theme_saec/components/hero_banner

    Unified Dashboard Hero — shared by student_dashboard.mustache,
    teacher_dashboard.mustache and admin_dashboard.mustache so every role's
    /my/ hero (avatar + role title + welcome subtitle + dynamic status pill
    + one primary action) follows the same structure and markup, styled by
    scss/saec/_hero.scss's .saec-hero-card. Each role's own PHP context
    builder (classes/dashboard/*_dashboard.php) is responsible for shaping
    its own real data into these plain fields — this partial has no
    role-specific logic of its own.

    Fields:
    - avatarurl: user's picture URL, or falsy to omit the avatar image.
    - herotitle: static role heading ("Panel del Alumno", etc.).
    - herosubtitle: "Bienvenido de nuevo, {fullname}. {resumen}" sentence.
    - pillicon: FontAwesome class suffix (e.g. "fa-clock-o"), no "fa " prefix.
    - pilltext: dynamic status text (next task/class, or system status).
    - pillvariant: one of primary|accent|warning|success — controls the
      pill's colour via a matching modifier class (scss/saec/_hero.scss).
    - actionlabel: falsy hides the action button entirely.
    - ispurgeaction: true renders a <button data-saec-admin-purge-cache>
      instead of a plain link, letting admin_dashboard.mustache's existing
      inline JS (root.find('[data-saec-admin-purge-cache]')) wire it up
      automatically — no template-specific JS needed here.
    - actionurl: link target when ispurgeaction is false.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "avatarurl": "https://example.org/pluginfile.php/1/user/icon/f1.jpg",
        "herotitle": "Panel del Alumno",
        "herosubtitle": "Bienvenido de nuevo, Ana García. Tienes 2 entregas pendientes.",
        "pillicon": "fa-clock-o",
        "pilltext": "Proyecto Final: Fase 1 · DW-2024-B1",
        "pillvariant": "warning",
        "actionlabel": "Entregar Tarea",
        "actionurl": "https://example.org/mod/assign/view.php?id=5",
        "ispurgeaction": false
    }
}}
<div class="saec-hero-card">
    <div class="saec-hero-avatar">
        {{#avatarurl}}
            <img src="{{{ avatarurl }}}" alt="">
        {{/avatarurl}}
    </div>
    <div class="saec-hero-body">
        <h1 class="saec-hero-title">{{ herotitle }}</h1>
        <p class="saec-hero-subtitle">{{ herosubtitle }}</p>

        <div class="saec-hero-actionbar">
            {{#pilltext}}
                <span class="saec-hero-pill saec-hero-pill--{{ pillvariant }}">
                    {{#pillicon}}<i class="icon fa {{ pillicon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{/pillicon}}
                    <span class="saec-hero-pill__text">{{ pilltext }}</span>
                </span>
            {{/pilltext}}

            {{#actionlabel}}
                {{#ispurgeaction}}
                    <button type="button" class="btn-saec-primary saec-hero-action-btn" data-saec-admin-purge-cache>
                        {{ actionlabel }}
                    </button>
                {{/ispurgeaction}}
                {{^ispurgeaction}}
                    <a href="{{{ actionurl }}}" class="btn-saec-primary saec-hero-action-btn">
                        {{ actionlabel }}
                    </a>
                {{/ispurgeaction}}
            {{/actionlabel}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
